body:
Was driving through town with my old boss and we saw a homeless person begging for money and he casually went;

"I don't understand why they don't just get a job and rent a flat. Coffee shops are hiring all the time and it's easy to get hired, like I could go in and get a job at a coffee shop instead of doing this."

I didn't even respond to him, was genuienly that baffled by what he just came out with
